        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I’ll use the pattern’s 4-by-2 repeating tile to keep the calculation constant-time, including for negative coordinates. I also found a mismatch: the README gives 10 for `(0, 0, 3, 3)`, while the local test expects 11. I’ll verify that case against the geometry before proceeding.",
